; Stage 16 R1 (design/stage16-ergonomics/repl-libraries.md §3.4): a failed import
; must leave the session exactly as it found it. One form per line.
;
; 1. the import dies partway through the library
(import-use "tests/fixtures/r1-import-fails.nuc")
; 2. the next diagnostic is attributed to <repl>, not to the failed library (D4)
(zzz 1)
; 3. the name the library registered before dying is gone again (§3.4 rollback)
(r1-registered)
; 4. a retry reports the same error rather than silently doing nothing (D4)
(import-use "tests/fixtures/r1-import-fails.nuc")
; 5. and an unrelated import still works
(import-use "tests/fixtures/r1-import-works.nuc")
(r1-works)
